      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 or TiO2 would be suitable oxidation-resistant coating materials for cast equiatomic HfNbTaTiZr.",
